OL,3,GNEWSABritain's oldest lido vows
OL,4,Acomeback after flood damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain's oldest lido will "definitely
OL,7,Freopen" despite suffering significant
OL,8,Fflood damage just months after opening,
OL,9,Faccording to the charitable trust which
OL,10,Fruns it.
OL,12,FCleveland Pools in Bath closed in
OL,13,FJanuary 2024 when the River Avon broke
OL,14,Fits banks and flooded the historic
OL,15,Fsite, only four months after it had
OL,16,Fwelcomed swimmers back following a
OL,17,Fmulti-million-pound restoration.
OL,19,FDetailed investigations have revealed
OL,20,Fboth mechanical and structural damage,
OL,21,Fmeaning major repairs and significant
OL,22,Ffundraising is needed.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
