OL,3,GNEWSABritain's oldest lido vows
OL,4,Acomeback after flood damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Askew, chair of Cleveland Pools
OL,7,FTrust, said: "We are moving as quickly
OL,8,Fand responsibly as we can towards
OL,9,Freopening the pools. It's definitely
OL,10,Fgoing to happen."
